<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Re sees favourable business trends.</title>
<headline>Swiss Re sees favourable business trends.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Reinsurance Co said on Friday its board of directors would propose raising the dividend on the basis of the improved 1996 result and a &quot;favourable assessment of current business trends.&quot;</p>
<p>In a statement on its 1996 results, Swiss Re did not say anything more about the outlook for the current year.</p>
<p>Swiss Re's group net profit rose 33 percent to 1.46 billion Swiss francs and it will propose to shareholders that the 1996 dividend be raised to 30 francs from 22.50 francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
